# The image copies one thing: artifacts/binacle-net. So this is an allowlist, not a list of leftovers to remember -
# ignore the whole repo, add that one folder back. Anything new in the tree is out of the context by default.
*
!artifacts/binacle-net

# GPL-3.0 sections 4 and 5 require a copy of the licence to travel with the binaries, and the vendored
# Apache and MIT components require their notices. A label is metadata, it is not a copy.
!NOTICE
!LICENSE.AGPL-3.0

# Last, so it beats the line above: the published folder carries the Config_Files/*.Development.json overrides
# and those must never land in the image.
**/*.Development.json
